note: HUMANLANG ODYSSEY: SEVEN WORLDS (the first slice). Made with HumanLang 0.6.2.
note: Your logo reveal plays first (play video), then the title, the Motherboard hub, World 1 (Say Hello) and
note: World 5 (Platform Peaks). The hero is the HL mascot, drawn at pixel size 1 like every important picture here.
note: Keys: left/right run, space jumps, enter talks, opens doors and confirms. On a phone: arrows, A = jump, B = enter.

use math
use text

note: The hero: the HL mascot (6 frames: stand, run, run, jump, hurt, cheer). Converted from the mascot pictures, pixel size 1.
make a sprite called hero with pixel size 1 and 6 frames
